							"text": "Implementation references:\n- CTC.TestUI.Wpf SystemTimeInputViewModel (stand-in system clock) -> SystemTimeMessage on pipe \"TrainControl.CTC\"\n- CtcNamedPipeReceiver.HandleAsync() / RouteAsync<SystemTimeMessage>() / Report()\n- ICTCService.SetSystemTimeAsync() / CTCService.SetSystemTimeAsync()\n- CTCService.DispatchTrainAsync() / ResolveRoute() / CreateMovementRequest() / AdvanceMovementPlansAsync()\n- AuthorityManager.CalculateInitialAuthorityMeters(), SpeedPlanner.CalculateInitialSpeed()\n- MovementPlanner.CreateStops() / RecalculatePlannedSpeeds()\n- IMessageSender.SendAsync() -> NamedPipeMessageSender.SendAsync() -> NamedPipeTransport.SendAsync()\n- MainWindowViewModel.OnCtcStateChanged(): SystemTime, TrainDispatched, DispatchFailed\n- App.OnStartup(): receiver.StatusReported -> MainWindowViewModel.InboundStatus"
						}
